      "title": "Landscape Technician I",
      "description": "Landscape Technician I - Manhattan, Kansas, United States Landscape Technician I - Manhattan, Kansas, United States Kiosk mode Landscape Technician I Apply Now Landscape Technician I This position exists to provide operation of a wide variety of medium and small sized equipment for completion of grounds tasks and assistance in general grounds maintenance. 522187 Manhattan, Kansas, United States Fac Grounds Maintenance Staff Full Time (USS) Closing at: Oct 18 2026 - 23:55 CDT On-site Add to favorites View favorites About This Role This position exists to provide operation of a wide variety of medium and small sized equipment for completion of grounds tasks and assistance in general grounds maintenance. About Us The role of the Grounds Maintenance and Landscape Department is to provide a safe, functional and aesthetically-pleasing exterior environment for the students, faculty and staff of Kansas State University. Worksite Description This position is On-site . All employees must reside in the United States when they begin working to comply with state law. K-State is unable to provide remote or hybrid work opportunities for residents of the state of Idaho. What You'll Need to Succeed Minimum Qualifications: Valid driver's license Preferred Qualifications: Six months of experience in equipment operation; education may be substituted for experience as determined relevant by the agency. Knowledge of the general practices applied in the care and safe operation of a wide variety of light to medium maintenance equipment, knowledge of standard safety practices. Ability to operate a wide variety of lighter and some heavy equipment. Ability to communicate, verbally and in writing; knowledge of grounds, tree, and shrub care. Sponsorship eligibility: Candidates must be legally authorized to work in the U.S. on an ongoing basis without sponsorship. How to Apply Please submit the following documents: Application Application Window Applications close on: October 18, 2026 Anticipated Hiring Pay Range Hourly $ 15.00 - $17.78 Sign up for job alerts First Name (required) 4d8865bb Last Name (required) 24a92e13 Email (required) 01be3bc9 Select one or more from the lists below to receive information about specific jobs: 11648cc7 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Custodial / Landscaping / Maintenance Custodial / Landscaping / Maintenance Employment Type Staff Full Time (USS) Staff Full Time (USS) Locations Manhattan, Kansas, United States Manhattan, Kansas, United States Worksite On-site On-site Sign Up! Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Save this job for later Add this job to your favorites or send it to yourself to apply later Save this job to your favorites or send it to yourself to apply later (required) f798a86e Last Name (required) e29148e6 Save this job to your favorites or send it to yourself to apply later d8621b78 Save Now! Please wait... Done Not You? We sent this job to you Share this job with a friend First Name (required) a5df4ead Last Name (required) 530c2e43 Email (required) 878cae6e Provide your friend's name and email and we'll send this job a1c07abf Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? Thanks for sharing this job! You may also be interested in Accounting Specialist (Accounts Receivable & Cashiering) Manhattan Vet Med Support Services Director II, Enterprise Cloud Applications Manhattan Division of Info Tech HR Manager Manhattan Provost Office Video Player is loading. Play Video Play Skip Backward Skip Forward Mute Current Time 0:00 / Duration 1:46 Loaded : 0.00% 0:00 Stream Type LIVE Seek to live, currently behind live LIVE Remaining Time - 1:46 1x Playback Rate Chapters Chapters Descriptions descriptions off , selected Captions captions settings , opens captions settings dialog captions off , se