    "https://careers.k-state.edu/jobs/office-specialist-iii-manhattan-kansas-united-states-b514fdb5-038d-42a9-ae80-1f0d8f29871f": {
      "title": "Office Specialist III",
      "description": "Office Specialist III - Manhattan, Kansas, United States Office Specialist III - Manhattan, Kansas, United States Kiosk mode Office Specialist III Apply Now Office Specialist III TRIO Education Support Services in the department of Student Belonging is seeking an office specialist. The office specialist will serve as the administrative assistant to the TRIO ESS Director and staff. This position is responsible for the fiscal accountability and fiscal integrity of the program through monthly reconciliation of FIS statements. The office specialist will prepare the annual performance report for submission to the US Department of Education. This is a full-time, 12-month, contracted position. 522200 Manhattan, Kansas, United States Student Belonging Staff Full Time (Unclassified - Term) Closing at: Oct 18 2026 - 23:55 CDT On-site About This Role This position serves as the departmental recordkeeping and accounting specialist for the Director and staff of TRIO Educational Supportive Services which is a federal and state funded program that provides tutoring, academic, career, and financial services for first generation, low income, and students with a documented disability. Federal regulations require that extensive records be maintained on all accepted student participants About Us Since 1972, TRIO ESS has focused on student success by providing comprehensive support for students that are 1st generation, income limited, and/or have a documented disability. TRIO ESS accepts 300 students each year, offering 1-1 services that help participants maintain a good GPA, persist year-to-year, and graduate on time. Worksite Description This position is On-site . 5 days per week All employees must reside in the United States when they begin working to comply with state law. K-State is unable to provide remote or hybrid work opportunities for residents of the state of Idaho. What You'll Need to Succeed Minimum Qualifications: Requires two years of relevant experience. Requirements may be met through a combination of education and experience. Preferred Qualifications: College degree and/or three years of experience in an office setting to include receptionist duties and business practices. Excellent computer skills, good working knowledge of Microsoft Office (Word and Excel preferred). Knowledge of University systems including KSIS, Navigate, Concur Good interpersonal and communication skills Ability to analyze, make recommendations for improvements and implement policies and procedures. Demonstrated ability to extract, analyze, and transmit technical information, prepare operating tabulations and reports, and make difficult arithmetic computations. Knowledge of and ability to organize groups of people and activities. Have a high-level professional demeanor and pleasant disposition. Good communication skills, both written and oral. Ability to work and create a positive environment and coach others to do the same TRIO budget experience Sponsorship eligibility: Candidates must be legally authorized to work in the U.S. on an ongoing basis without sponsorship How to Apply Please submit the following documents: Letter of interest detailing experience as it applies to this position. Resume Three professional references with contact information. Application Window Applications close on: October 18, 2026 Anticipated Hiring Pay Range $18.0419 - $19.4038 hourly Sign up for job alerts First Name (required) 27ff9555 Last Name (required) d6e6b420 Email (required) 4756b365 Select one or more from the lists below to receive information about specific jobs: ac8c2a8f Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Administrative / Professional Business / Accounting / Finance Administrative / Professional Business / Accounting / Finance Employment Type Staff Full Time (Unclassified - Term) Staff Full Time (Unclassified - Term) Locations Manhattan, Kansas, United States Manhattan, Kansas, United States Worksite On-site On-site Sign Up! Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Save this job for later Add this job to your favorites or send it to yourself to apply later Save this job to your favorites or send it to yourself to apply later (required) 080a092f Last Name (required) ac7bb5ed Save this job to your favorites or send it to yourself to apply later 1b1ebbe5 Save Now! Please wait... Done Not You? We sent this job to you Share this job with a friend First Name (required) d90fd6ac Last Name (required) f50cd7b3 Email (required) f6917cfb Provide your friend's name and email and we'll send this job 350184bb Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? Thanks for sharing this job! You may also be interested in Accounting Specialist (Accounts Receivable & Cashiering) Manhattan Vet Med Support Services Director II, Enterprise Cloud Applications Manhattan Division of Info Tech HR Manager Manhattan Provost Office Video Player is loading. Play Video Play Skip Backward Skip Forward Mute Current Time 0:00 / Duration 1:46 Loaded : 0.00% 0:00 Stream Type LIVE Seek to live, currently behind live LIVE Remaining Time - 1:46 1x Playback Rate Chapters Chapters Descriptions descriptions off , selected Captions captions settings , opens captions settings dialog captions off , selected Audio Track Picture-in-Picture Fullscreen This is a modal window. Beginning of dialog window. Escape will cancel and close the window. Text Color White Black Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Opaque Semi-Transparent Text Background Color Black White Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Opaque Semi-Transparent Transparent Caption Area Background Color Black White Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Transparent Semi-Transparent Opaque Font Size 50% 75% 100% 125% 150% 175% 200% 300% 400% Text Edge Style None Raised Depressed Uniform Drop